From b37f0fc0ab1af6c0481ae9ed74d7e22aa150f15e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:59:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: wcn36xx: Skip feature exchange with firmware 1.2.2.15

The Express stock firmware M8960AAAAANAAW1050126H reports API 1.2.2.15
and does not answer the optional feature capability exchange. Each
interface start consequently waits for the ten-second HAL timeout
before proceeding with the default capability bitmap.

A shorter userspace interface setup deadline can cancel the caller
while it waits, causing the following DMA allocation to fail with
EINTR. Extend the existing 1.2.2.24 feature-exchange exception to the
observed 1.2.2.15 API. Keep all other firmware negotiation and the
separate station, BSS and beacon format decisions unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
index ad8a4bd91..d94ab42aa 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/wcn36xx/main.c
@@ -243,7 +243,8 @@ static int wcn36xx_start(struct ieee80211_hw *hw)
 		goto out_free_dxe_ctl;
 	}
 
-	if (!wcn36xx_is_fw_version(wcn, 1, 2, 2, 24)) {
+	if (!wcn36xx_is_fw_version(wcn, 1, 2, 2, 24) &&
+	    !wcn36xx_is_fw_version(wcn, 1, 2, 2, 15)) {
 		ret = wcn36xx_smd_feature_caps_exchange(wcn);
 		if (ret)
 			wcn36xx_warn("Exchange feature caps failed\n");
-- 
2.43.0

